      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TAP OUT POPPY (2) turned spotting a big start finishing eighth (18.01) last time in a Grade 5 at this track. Has a strong winning record here at this journey. Smart beginner who should take advantage of the low draw. Should bounce back. REEL'EM AISHA (1) wasn't far away at the finish when 4th and beaten only 4 lengths (17.87) at this track. Form from her last run is proving strong. Key runner who gets her chance to atone. JUNGLE MASTER (7) turned in a better effort at Gosford last start, finishing second behind Reborn Randy (22.45) in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Solid beginner and with a good start should have clear running out wide. Expected to be in this for a long way. KEYLIN (4) is in the mix despite missing out at this track last time.",
